GerClaw shared medical knowledge provider

Derived from dsh-library 0.1.3 (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-library/tree/0.1.3

GerClaw retains LibraryStore, chunking, embedding and retrieval logic. It
replaces the upstream command/Tool surface with a read-only shared Cordis
Service and receives storage through a Loader-managed isolate group.
